SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P><HR SIZE="2" NOSHADE COLOR="#000000" ALIGN="left"> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><B><I>
<A NAME="rom82538_27"></A>How does a &#147;best efforts&#148; offering work? What happens if you don&#146;t raise at least $2,500,000 in gross offering proceeds? </I></B></FONT></P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT
SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">When shares are offered on a &#147;best efforts&#148; basis, the broker-dealers participating in the offering have no firm
