SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>  <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2">We will not sell any shares unless we raise a minimum of $2,500,000 in gross offering proceeds from persons who are not
