<A NAME="rom82538_32"></A>Are there any special restrictions on the ownership or transfer of shares? </I></B></FONT></P> <P STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:-6px"><FONT SIZE="1">&nbsp;</FONT></P>  <P
