STYLE="margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px; text-indent:4%"><FONT FACE="Times New Roman" SIZE="2"><I>Mortgage Loans Involving Affiliates</I>. Our charter prohibits us from investing in or making mortgage loans in which the transaction is with KBS
